EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Hmm?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} We haven't met, right?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}They call me {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Nice to meet you!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I hate to break this to you, but
