{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Come to my town!
Sounds rough.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Buenas?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Nos conocemos?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Servidor se llama {{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:0005:0001:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
